        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion C9-0, Victorian Rose Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis ornate deadbolt meets ANSI 156.5 Grade 2 criteria. Made out of solid brass, it is available in a wide array of beautiful finishes. The Victorian Rose Deadbolt features a highly decorated plate, bringing to mind visions of the old world. A single cylinder deadbolt, it is locked and unlocked by a key from the outside and by a thumbturn from the inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion C9 Victorian Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1\" Throw Bolt With Interior Roll Pins</li>\r\n<li>Heavy-Duty strike with 3 screws for added security.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass schlage SC1 keyway & 5 pin system.</li>\r\n<li>Meets ANSI 156.5 Grade 2 Criteria.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Fusion C9 Victorian Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable  1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
