                "title": "Victorian Rose Deadbolt, Fusion C9",
                "description": "Fusion C9, Victorian Rose Deadbolt -- This ornate deadbolt meets ANSI 156.5 Grade 2 criteria. Made out of solid brass, it is available in a wide array of beautiful finishes. The Victorian Rose Deadbolt features a highly decorated plate, bringing to mind visions of the old world. A single cylinder deadbolt, it is locked and unlocked by a key from the outside and by a thumbturn from the inside.\r\n",
